### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### RESEND OTP TEST CASES
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────


### ✅ TEST 1 — Happy Path (Signup Flow)
### Setup: First call /signup to create a pending session, then resend
### Expected: 200 — "A new OTP has been sent to your email."

POST http://localhost:8080/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "shahidoulan@gmail.com"
}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────


### ✅ TEST 2 — Happy Path (Login Flow)
### Setup: First call /login to create an OTP session, then resend
### Expected: 200 — "A new OTP has been sent to your email."

POST http://localhost:8080/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "shahidoulan@gmail.com"
}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────


### ❌ TEST 3 — No Active Session
### Setup: Use an email that never called /signup or /login
### Expected: 400/500 — "No active session found for this email. Please signup or login again."

POST http://localhost:8080/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ghost@gmail.com"
}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────


### ❌ TEST 4 — Rate Limit Exceeded
### Setup: Run this request 4 times back to back on the same email
### First 3 → 200 OK
### 4th attempt → Expected: 429 — "Too many resend-otp attempts. Please try again after 10 minutes."

POST http://localhost:8080/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "shahidoulan@gmail.com"
}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────


### ❌ TEST 5 — Empty Email
### Expected: 400 or validation error

POST http://localhost:8080/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────


### ❌ TEST 6 — Missing Email Field Entirely
### Expected: 400 or validation error

POST http://localhost:8080/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{}